 CellLabel->"Out[36]=",ExpressionUUID->"1a8789b1-04d2-407c-93b2-ab751dfa996e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Sec. III, moments of the normalized sum: the rescaled recursion (III.3)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c97d4bf2-0654-47c4-88c7-8b1fd0cc8a55"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
check[\"Sec. III, moments of the normalized sum: |(1+x)^(-r/2) - 1 + r x/2| \
<= r(r+2)/8 x^2 for 0 < x <= 1 (r = 1..12)\",
  And @@ Flatten@Table[N[Abs[(1 + x)^(-r/2) - 1 + r x/2]] <= N[r (r + 2)/8 \
x^2], {r, 1, 12}, {x, 1/50, 1, 1/50}]]\
