    RGBColor[0, 
     Rational[2, 3], 0], StripOnInput -> False], "\"   \"", 
   "\"Sec. III, moments of the normalized sum: u_n (1 - a/n) = 1 - lambda_r/n \
+ [r a/(2 n^2) + omega_n (1 - a/n)], with u_n = 1 - r/(2n) + omega_n and \
lambda_r = r/2 + a\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0036532335243464`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[38]=",ExpressionUUID->"8d20b25a-2e2a-4e7f-a902-1ca7881de59f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
check[\"Sec. III, moments of the normalized sum: lambda_r = r/2 + C(r,2) beta \
= (r/2)(1 + (r-1) beta), and C(r,2) c/lambda_r = (r-1) c/(1 + (r-1) beta)\",
  Simplify[r/2 + r (r - 1)/2 be == (r/2) (1 + (r - 1) be)] && Simplify[(r (r \
- 1)/2) c/((r/2) (1 + (r - 1) be)) == (r - 1) c/(1 + (r - 1) be)]]\
\>", "Input",
