delta_n), delta_n = 4 Sqrt[2] b^(3/2) M3 (n+1)^(-3/2) (three noise laws; b = \
1/3, 1, 2, 10; n = 1..60)\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0036532420387783`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[73]=",ExpressionUUID->"d7be4160-c6ca-4f09-b61b-1eeff27f1aff"]
}, Open  ]],

