   "\"(A.1): the five bounds on the truncated noise (noise +1/-1 and skewed \
two-point; b = 1/10..10; eps = 1/2..1/50)\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.003653242108197*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[78]=",ExpressionUUID->"3081d090-0de2-4f96-b68d-5ea7f49d157e"]
}, Open  ]],

