Cell["\<\
check[\"App. A, bounds: 3 Sqrt[b] (2/Sqrt[b] + Sqrt[b]) + 2 (4 kappa + 2 + 4 \
b) = 10 + 11 b + 8 kappa; C_A/a_1 = 22 + 19 b + 4/b; C_B/a_1 = 3 + 4 kappa = \
7 + 2/b\",
  Simplify[3 Sqrt[b] (2/Sqrt[b] + Sqrt[b]) + 2 (4 kap[b] + 2 + 4 b) == 10 + \
