     Rational[2, 3], 0], StripOnInput -> False], "\"   \"", 
   "\"Table II: at the largest N the Kolmogorov distance is at the level of \
the sampling floor in all eleven cases (below 1.95/Sqrt[M] + 0.002)\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
