within 8% at every checkpoint\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.003653556536438*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[135]=",ExpressionUUID->"50073197-101a-4829-bde4-0cac0ed48901"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
check[\"Remark after Theorem B (additional simulation, displaced start): the \
sample mean of S_N/Sqrt[N] at the largest N equals 4/Sqrt[N] within five \
standard errors (martingale property)\",
  Abs[Mean[simD[\"final\"]] - 4/Sqrt[nMax]] < 5 \
StandardDeviation[simD[\"final\"]]/Sqrt[mPaths]]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[136]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9286e026-624e-48b2-a16a-76fb6e8f5cbf"],

