Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
7. Figures 1 and 2, and an additional figure for the displaced start\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3d4989ee-08c0-47ba-aca3-efe464a2b751"],

Cell["\<\
Section 7 adds three simulation runs (b = -1/3, -1/6, 0, about a quarter of \
the time of Section 6) for panels (c), (e) and (f) of Figure 1. The complete \
ten-panel Figure 1, with panel (j) for q = 2, is assembled at the end of \
Section 9 as fig1Q2.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3b416f9a-f56d-4c6a-bc7b-c17627698380"],

Cell["\<\
Figure 1 of the manuscript: ten panels, one for each interval and boundary \
value of q. Three runs are added to those of Section 6: b = -1/3 (q = -1, \
semicircle law), b = -1/6 (q = 1/2) and b = 0 (q = 1, Gaussian)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"42758b12-5954-4cca-82ea-3d454e455e6a"],

Cell["\<\
fig1Extra = {{-1/3, \"three\"}, {-1/6, \"uniform\"}, {0, \"exp\"}};\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[138]:=",ExpressionUUID->"1f82ee1e-ad91-4177-bdce-f1a8b8e493be"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
fig1Time = First@AbsoluteTiming[Do[sims[cs] = simulate[cs[[1]], cs[[2]], \
None, mPaths, nMax], {cs, fig1Extra}]]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[139]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7ec746cd-7d8a-4f46-b72a-39b8e9983459"],

