Cell["\<\
epsList[b_, at_] := Select[{1/5, 1/10, 1/20, 1/40, 1/80, 1/160}, # \
Max[Abs[at[[All, 1]]]] Sqrt[b] <= 1/4 &];\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[171]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3a03cee6-56d4-4a9d-b80b-f891b23ac190"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
defTab = Flatten[Table[With[{es = epsList[b, atoms[k]]}, <|\"b\" -> b, \
\"noise\" -> k, \"eps\" -> es, \"w1\" -> (defect[b, #, atoms[k]] & /@ es)|>], \
{b, {1/3, 1, 2}}, {k, {\"two\", \"rademacher\"}}], 1];\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[172]:=",ExpressionUUID->"855f285d-48fe-438d-9373-1a3b88e935b0"],

