Cell["\<\
The explanation of the powers: the term of order eps^3 is (E xi^3/6) Int h''' \
sigma^3 g. Taking the supremum over h gives the prediction W1/eps^3 -> (|E \
xi^3|/6) Int |(sigma^3 g)''| dy\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"14b8d054-de5c-480d-8c96-dfc0929be191"],

Cell["\<\
thirdCoef[b_] := NIntegrate[Evaluate[Abs[D[(1 + b y^2)^(3/2 - kap[b])/zz[b, \
1], {y, 2}]]], {y, -Infinity, Infinity}, MaxRecursion -> 30]/6;\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[179]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6932a99c-4560-4037-b302-6cd0073ce9cd"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
check[\"Lemma 6 (additional numerical check): sigma^3 g is constant for b = 1 \
(kappa = 3/2), so the term of order eps^3 vanishes for every noise\", kap[1] \
== 3/2 && Simplify[D[(c + y^2)^(3/2) (c + y^2)^(-kap[1]), y]] === 0]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[180]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b5964451-e6d4-4435-9e7d-13b5abf09ce5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{
   StyleBox["\"PASS\"", Bold, 
