     Rational[2, 3], 0], StripOnInput -> False], "\"   \"", 
   "\"Lemma 6 (additional numerical check): sigma^3 g is constant for b = 1 \
(kappa = 3/2), so the term of order eps^3 vanishes for every noise\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.003653741297756*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[180]=",ExpressionUUID->"3d710b04-e38c-4867-bb1a-3f4d7620d99c"]
}, Open  ]],

