E xi^3 = 3/2; for the noise +1/-1 E xi^3 = 0\", Total[#[[1]]^3 #[[2]] & /@ \
atoms[\"two\"]] == 3/2 && Total[#[[1]]^3 #[[2]] & /@ atoms[\"rademacher\"]] \
== 0]\
