   "\"Cor. D, proof, final step: (theta ln N)^(5/3) (1 + ln N) N^(chi - 1/2) \
-> 0 when chi < 1/2 (theta = 1/20, chi = 49/100)\""},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.003653742673739*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[210]=",ExpressionUUID->"b5fc4af4-3a3a-40eb-a538-78d958590d2e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
check[\"Corollary D: q_N = (1 + 4 b_N)/(1 + 2 b_N) -> 2 as b_N -> Infinity\", \
Limit[qOf[b], b -> Infinity] == 2]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[211]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ee5fca6a-8677-4607-89fc-28d754ca55fe"],

